    <string name="export_preset_full">Full export</string>
    <string name="export_preset_full_sub">Maintenance, documents, all records, readings and fill-ups</string>
    <string name="export_prompt_advice">Use the data below to make a short maintenance plan: what to check first, what to schedule, and what information is missing. For each action, give the supporting record and a date or condition. Separate facts from assumptions. Do not invent the engine, trim, symptoms, faults or repair costs. Ask for the exact vehicle version or service schedule when needed. Do not recommend postponing work solely because the app says it is not yet due.</string>
    <string name="export_prompt_full">Review the vehicle data below: maintenance, documents, history and fuel. Give a short prioritized action list supported by records, then identify gaps and inconsistencies. Separate facts from assumptions. Do not invent the engine, trim, symptoms, faults or repair costs. Do not infer vehicle condition from consumption and due dates alone; ask for missing vehicle details before specifying a service schedule.</string>
